Build and install `libfprint-tod` package from: https://github.com/chax/solus-packages/blob/libfprintd-tod/packages/l/libfprint-tod/package.yml

Build and install `libfprint-2-tod1-goodix`

```sh
sudo eopkg.py3 bi --ignore-safety https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chax/solus-3rd-party-chax/master/desktop/library/libfprint-2-tod1-goodix/pspec.xml
sudo eopkg it libfprint-2-tod1-goodix-*.eopkg;sudo rm libfprint-2-tod1-goodix-*.eopkg
```

This Goodix driver supports following device IDs:
```
27c6:538c
27c6:533c
27c6:530c
27c6:5840
```

Binaries downloaded from: http://dell.archive.canonical.com/updates/pool/public/libf/libfprint-2-tod1-goodix/

